  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Local Resilience in Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The FAO-proposed BLRS interventions will prioritize women, young people and PWDs for positive coping strategies, longer term food security and self-reliance through market-driven food processing enterprises, FAO will also ensure that the identified locations and communities have better options for food production and increased economic opportunities. Another criterion for selection of sub-districts will be the level of market functionality and access.</narrative>
  </description>
